Table full name: CENSUS_BUREAU_USA.UTILITY_US.US_CSA_AREA
Column name: aff_geo_code Type: TEXT Description: 14-digit codes that identify the summary level of data, the geographic component of the data and FIPS codes that uniquely identify the data. Corresponds to geo_id from American Fact Finder data
Column name: name Type: TEXT Description: Current full text name of CSA
Column name: csa_code Type: TEXT Description: Current Combined Statistical Area (CSA) code
Column name: geo_code Type: TEXT Description: Unique identifier for each CSA; should be same as csa_code
Column name: lsad_code Type: TEXT Description: Legal/Statistical area description (LSAD) code for a given CSA.

M0 indicates "CSA (suffix)".  A full list of LSAD codes can be found here: https://www.census.gov/geo/reference/lsad.html
Column name: area_water_meters Type: NUMBER Description: Current water area, in square meters
Column name: area_land_meters Type: NUMBER Description: Current land area, in square meters
Column name: csa_geom Type: BINARY Description: Geographical representation of the polygon that defines the perimeter of each CSA. This should be used for geographic visualization
